# The USB test kernel for real devices (docs/usb.md "The usbhost guest"; images/build.sh linux-usbhost):
# linux-usb's kernel (images/usb/linux.fragment) and these class drivers, for the guest-level tests
# through WebUSB and WebHID: cdc_acm for the dummy_hcd ACM gadget, usbhid with hidraw for the uhid
# devices. A kernel of its own, so linux-usb's runs and their steps stay as they are.
CONFIG_USB_ACM=y
CONFIG_HID_SUPPORT=y
CONFIG_HID=y
CONFIG_HIDRAW=y
CONFIG_HID_GENERIC=y
CONFIG_USB_HID=y
